<title>RUSSIA: Russian gem deal under presidential review - agency.</title>
<headline>Russian gem deal under presidential review - agency.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>A stalled gem export deal between Russia and South Africa's De Beers is under review by the presidential administration, a key step towards formalising the agreement, Interfax news agency said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Interfax quoted Finance Minister Alexander Livshits as saying that the Finance Ministry had finished its review of the draft agreement, which must be signed by President Boris Yeltsin.</p>
</text>
